# Build flags (Vite, VITE_*) – set them per Netlify site / deploy context under
# Site configuration → Environment variables, not here (a committed value reaches every build):
#   VITE_DEBUG=true                     debug bar + QR generator (always on with `npm run dev`)
#   VITE_SHOW_LOCKED_ENTRIES=true|false unconsulted entries listed locked (default: dev yes, builds no)
# Locally: put them in client/.env.local (not committed).
